        265.7,
        74.8,
        265.7
      ],
      "text": "In pursuance to the letter No. PER(AP)C-B(2)-1/2019 dated\n28/12/2021 issued by the Department of Personnel and on the recommendations of the\nScreening Committee of the Directorate of Health Safety & Regulation, H.P., the competent\nauthority is pleased to order regularisation of services of the following Food Safety Officers\nin the Department of Health Safety & Regulation, in the pay band of Rs. 5910-20200 + 3000\nG.P. with immediate effect in public interest:-"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        70.7,
        282.8,
        488.7,
        282.8,
        488.7,
        453.8,
        70.7,
        453.8
      ],
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><td>Sr.</td><td>Name of Food Safety Officer</td><td>Present Place of Posting</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>No.</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>1.</td><td>Sh. Sachin Lakhanpal</td><td>CMO Office Mandi</td></tr><tr><td>2.</td><td>Sh.Abhishek Thakur</td><td>CMO Office Kinnaur</td></tr><tr><td>3.</td><td>Sh. Anuj Sharma</td><td>CMO Office Solan</td></tr><tr><td>4.</td><td>Ms. Varsha</td><td>CMO Office Mandi</td></tr><tr><td>5.</td><td>Sh. Kheem Singh</td><td>CMO Office Kullu</td></tr><tr><td>6.</td><td>Ms. Priyanka Kashyap</td><td>CMO Office Una</td></tr><tr><td>7.</td><td>Smt. Sugandhi Kaundal</td><td>CMO Office Kangra</td></tr><tr><td>8.</td><td>Ms. Madhu Bala</td><td>CMO Office Hamirpur</td></tr><tr><td>9.</td><td>Smt. Priya Negi</td><td>CMO Office Shimla</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 10,
      "poly": [
        144.9,
        469.3,
        412.2,
        469.3,
        412.2,
        481.5,
        144.9,
        481.5
      ],
      "text": "The terms and conditions of regularisation are as under :-"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "poly": [
        76.2,
        499.3,
        194.3,
        499.3,
        194.3,
        508.5,
        76.2,
        508.5
      ],
      "text": "Terms and Conditions:-"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 12,
      "poly": [
        92.4,
        527.4,
        514.1,
        527.8,
        514.1,
        570.3,
        92.4,
        570.0
      ],
      "text": "(1) That on Regularisation, the officers shall be appointed on the minimum of the pay\nscale i.e. Rs. 5910-20200 + 3000 and they will be entitled to get the revised pay scale\nof Rs. 10300-34800 + 4200 after completion of 2 years of regular service."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 13,
      "poly": [
        91.7,
        584.8,
        513.8,
        584.8,
        513.8,
        625.9,
        91.7,
        625.9
      ],
      "text": "(2) These Food Safety officers will be entitled to draw dearness and other allowances at\nthe rate admissible and subject to the conditions laid down in the rules and\norders/instructions in force issued by the State Government from time to time."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 14,
      "poly": [
        92.7,
        642.1,
        513.4,
        642.5,
        513.4,
        666.6,
        92.7,
        666.2
      ],
      "text": "(3) The Regularisation shall carry with it the liability to serve in any part of Himachal\nPradesh."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 15,
      "poly": [
        92.7,
        695.1,
        513.8,
        695.8,
        513.8,
        749.5,
        92.7,
        748.7
      ],
      "text": "(4) The Regularisation will be on probation for a period of 2 years and during the period\nof probation his/her service can be terminated at any time by giving one month's\nnotice or pay in lieu thereof by the appointing authority without assigning any\nreason."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 16,
      "poly": [
        92.7,
        766.1,
        513.1,
        766.9,
        513.1,
        793.5,
        92.7,
        792.8
      ],
      "text": "(5) The regularisation is subject to the Character and antecedents of the candidates being\nfound satisfactory on verification."
    }
